87733"><a href="https://wa.me/6281944335200" class="button center" target="_blank">Get in Touch</a></div></div></div><div class="ed-element ed-container wv-boxed wv-spacer" id="ed-2849385684"><div class="inner" id="testimonial-1"><div class="ed-element ed-headline custom-theme" id="ed-2849385687"><h2>Project History</h2></div><div class="ed-element ed-spacer" id="ed-2849385690"><div class="space"></div></div><div class="ed-element ed-container wv-boxed wv-spacer wv-overflow_visible preset-slider-content-v3-wide-dots" id="ed-2849385693"><div class="inner"><div class="ed-element ed-content-slider wv-overflow_visible" id="ed-2849385696"><div class="slider-container has-dots" data-parameters="{&quot;items&quot;:[],&quot;adaptiveHeight&quot;:true,&quot;slidesToShow&quot;:1,&quot;slidesToScroll&quot;:1,&quot;rows&quot;:1,&quot;slidesPerRow&quot;:1,&quot;height&quot;:&quot;500px&quot;,&quot;animation&quot;:&quot;slide&quot;,&quot;animationSpeed&quot;:&quot;800ms&quot;,&quot;direction&quot;:&quot;horizontal&quot;,&quot;autoplay&quot;:true,&quot;autoplaySpeed&quot;:&quot;5s&quot;,&quot;pauseOnHover&quot;:true,&quot;loop&quot;:true,&quot;nav&quot;:true,&quot;dots&quot;:true,&quot;enlarge&quot;:false,&quot;retinaImages&quot;:false,&quot;lazyLoad&quot;:&quot;progressive&quot;,&quot;variableWidth&quot;:false,&quot;centerMode&quot;:false,&quot;centerPadding&quot;:&quot;50px&quot;,&quot;responsive&quot;:[{&quot;breakpoint&quot;:976,&quot;settings&quot;:{&quot;slidesToShow&quot;:1,&quot;slidesToScroll&quot;:1}},{&quot;breakpoint&quot;:767,&quot;settings&quot;:{&quot;slidesToShow&quot;:1,&quot;slidesToScroll&quot;:1}}]}" aria-roledescription="carousel"><div class="ed-slider-item"><div class="ed-element ed-headline custom-theme" id="ed-2849385699"><h2>Exceptional Software Development Experience!</h2></div><div class="ed-element ed-text custom-theme" id="ed-2849385708"><p>Working with Sixer0 was a game-changer for our project. The technical expertise and innovative solutions delivered exceeded our expectations!</p></div></div><div class="ed-slider-item"><div class="ed-element ed-headline custom-theme" id="ed-2849385702"><h2>Transformed Our Business Processes!</h2></div><div class="ed-element ed-text custom-theme" id="ed-2849385711"><p>Thanks to the tailored ERP system created by Budi, our workflow has improved significantly. Highly recommended for any business looking to streamline operations.</p></div></div><div class="ed-slider-item"><div class="ed-element ed-headline custom-theme" id="ed-2849385705"><h2>Innovative and Professional!</h2></div><div class="ed-element ed-text custom-theme" id="ed-2849385714"><p>Budi’s approach to software development is nothing short of inspiring. The quality of work and attention to detail stands out in every project.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="ed-element ed-container wv-boxed wv-spacer" id="ed-2849388057"><div class="inner" id="modules-1"><div class="ed-element ed-headline custom-theme" id="ed-2849388060"><h2>Sample Project</h2></div><div class="ed-element ed-spacer" id="ed-2849388063"><div class="space"></div></div><div class="ed-element ed-collection-container wv-boxed wv-spacer preset-blog-blog preset-collection-container-default wv-overflow_visible" id="ed-2849388066"><div class="inner collection-loading" data-collection-bind="%7B%22id%22%3A%226a06c46afcec0643ac07d298%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22Modules-1%22%2C%22slug%22%3A%22modules-1%22%2C%22link%22%3A%7B%22type%22%3A%22self%22%2C%22href%22%3A%22https%3A//cms.websitebutler.de/api/collections/68b016b77793a63b062a9422%22%7D%2C%22paginate%22%3Afalse%2C%22limit%22%3A%226%22%7D" style="opacity:0"><article class="ed-element ed-collection-item blog-box wv-overflow_visible" id="ed-2849388069"><div class="inner"><div class="ed-element ed-container wv-overflow_visible" id="ed-2849388072"><div class="inner"><figure class="ed-element ed-image" id="ed-2849388075"><img src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20width='1024'%20viewBox='0%200%201024%20